{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "amara.bond",
  "kind": "character",
  "title": "温泉審理、初の無罪判決",
  "summary": "賞品の温泉旅行。浴衣のアマラと卓球と、「両者勝訴」の誕生",
  "ownership": {
    "arcId": "character.amara",
    "characterId": "amara",
    "stage": "bond"
  },
  "trigger": {
    "actions": [
      "work",
      "rest"
    ],
    "when": {
      "all": [],
      "any": [],
      "none": []
    },
    "repeat": {
      "mode": "once-per-run"
    },
    "priority": 400,
    "weight": 1
  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "温泉旅館・鏡見の湯",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "amara.bond.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/amara-bond-onsen-table-tennis-v1.png",
        "alt": "浴衣姿で卓球に全力を出すアマラとミミ"
      },
      {
        "id": "amara.bond.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-hot-spring-ryokan.png",
        "alt": "温泉旅館の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "amara.bond.asset.still.002",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/amara-bond-v2.png",
        "alt": "停電の暗闇、月明かりがアマラの横顔を照らす瞬間"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "先週の大会の賞品は、温泉旅行。ペア一組、一泊二日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "くじ引きの結果——私と、アマラさん。神様、話が急です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "amara.bond.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "旅館に着いて三十秒で、アマラさんは効能書きの前に立った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「すべての疲れに効く」……嫌な予感しかしない。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "開廷します。本日の被告——「すべての疲れに効く」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "誇大表示の疑い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "温泉を裁かないでください!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "実証します。証人ミミ。あなたは今、疲れていますか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "え、まあ、書類仕事で肩が……"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "では、入浴後に再尋問します。回答の変化を、証拠として採用します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "かくして私は、人生で初めて「証拠」として温泉に入った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "いいお湯だった。証拠として、最高だった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "湯上がり、縁側。浴衣のアマラさんが、髪を下ろしていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "いつも法廷の人が、今日は夜風の人だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見てはいけないものを見た気がして、麦茶を一気飲みした。耳が、熱い。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "再尋問します。——肩は。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……治りました。完全に。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "被告「すべての疲れに効く」は、無罪。……初めて、無罪を出しました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "世界を裁く人の初無罪、賞品は温泉の効能書きだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.013b",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.013b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "アマラさんは判決文を書く手を止めて、少し困ってた。うれしい時の顔を、まだ知らないだけ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "記念に、卓球やりましょう。温泉といえば卓球です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "規則の条文を要求します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "先に11点。以上です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.017a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.017a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "条文が一行。……美しい法です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "amara.bond.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.018a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.018a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "アマラさんは強かった。ただし一打ごとに「今の回転の定義は」と確認が入る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.018b",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.018b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "だからラリー一本に三分。浴衣の袖をたすき掛け、髪も結び直して卓球にも全力だった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.019a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.019a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "10対10。最終ラリーの途中で、消灯時間が来た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.019b",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.019b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "真っ暗な卓球室に、球の音が三回跳ねて止まった。引き分け。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.020a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.020a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……判決が、出せません。私の世界には、勝ちと負けの項目しか、ないので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.021a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.021a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "引き分けは、両方勝ちってことでいいんですよ。うちのカジノでは、そうです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.022a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.022a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……控訴します。……いえ。記録に残します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.022b",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.022b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "「本日の勝負、両者勝訴」と。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "amara.bond.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.023a",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.023a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「本日の温泉に、異議なし。次回期日の継続を求める」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.line.023b",
      "lineId": "amara.bond.line.023b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "次も二人で、という意味に読めたのは、湯あたりのせいにしておく。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "amara.bond.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "amara.bond.choice.001",
          "label": "消灯後だけど、「両者勝訴」の練習にもう一本つきあう",
          "result": "月明かりの卓球室で、こっそり三本。全部「両者勝訴」に。仲居さんに見つかり、二人で廊下に正座「ごめんなさい」帰り道、アマラさんが「正座も、悪くない判決でした」以後、作戦会議はなぜか卓球で始まる",
          "intent": "勝敗のない時間を、この人の辞書に増やす",
          "promise": "読みにくい作戦になる代わりに、この人だけの成長を大きく進める。",
          "memory": "「両者勝訴」を発明した温泉の夜を、二人とも判例として引用する。",
          "tone": "wild",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "amara"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 9,
              "ownership": -2
            },
            {
